  "description": "The erection of a single story extension to the rear of the property and a dormer extension to the rear gable roof of the property. The single story L shaped extension will include filling in the side return of the property and a meter long extension at the rear of the property. This extension will be utilised as a kitchen dining zone with access to the garden through sliding doors. The extension will be made from london yellow brick to match the rest of the house and surrounding properties. The roof extension will consist of a Zinc cladded rear dormer extension, matching the colour of the rest of the roof, at the back of the property. At the front of the property there will be three velux windows. The roof extension will be used as a principle bedroom and en suite bathroom.",
